al</span></span><span class=\"en hx-rt\">Approved Document K has not had a substantial review in more than 20 years</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"en\">23 Oct</span></span></a></li><li class=\"k-journal\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"journal/three-ai-stories-week-plus-one/\" data-go=\"5\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"en\">Journal</span></span><span class=\"en hx-rt\">Three AI stories this week, plus one product I wanted to dig into</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"en\">23 Oct</span></span></a></li>"}, "zh": {"slides": "<li class=\"hx-s fit ed k-lab\" data-i=\"3\" data-new=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"lab/st-albans-abbey/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"hx-bg\"><img data-src=\"../img/lab/st-albans-abbey.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-card\"><img data-src=\"../img/lab/st-albans-abbey.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width:860px) 100vw, 72vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-ed\"><span class=\"zh hx-ei\" lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"hx-ek\">10月24日 · 立體歷史模型 · 英國</span><span class=\"hx-es\">一座山丘上的十七個世紀：以互動立體模型呈現 St Albans 座堂、其城鎮及羅馬古城 Verulamium，並以時間軸逐個世紀重建這座修道院。</span><span class=\"hx-cta\">開啟工具 &rarr;</span></span></span></a><em class=\"hx-kind k-lab\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">實驗室</span></em></li><li class=\"hx-s fit ed k-journal\" data-i=\"4\" data-new=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"journal/approved-document-k-has-not-had/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"hx-bg\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/approved-document-k-has-not-had/thumb.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-card\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/approved-document-k-has-not-had/01.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width:860px) 100vw, 72vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-ed\"><span class=\"zh hx-ei\" lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"hx-ek\">2026 年 10 月 23 日 · 建築規例</span><span class=\"hx-eq\"><b aria-hidd